{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e10-scene-11",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "我自己加盟十二歌王  (Joining Twelve Singers Myself)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xin_huimei": "辛惠美",
    "agent": "经纪人"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After her fan-club president donates three million yuan to charity for a thank-you dinner, Xin Huimei learns that major talent agencies are boycotting Chun Yuqiao's Twelve Singers revamp—and immediately offers to step onto the stage herself. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你是我的粉丝会会长，你想见我一面并不难啊，这是何必呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "说吧，你这次见我什么事？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "总编室淳于总制作人这次的改版方案非常大胆，我个人非常喜欢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "好，我会帮忙的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我自己加盟十二歌王，然后参加宣传，你看这样怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "不愧是商业世家之子呀，真是人尽其用。我没问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "不过我很好奇，你为什么对这个总编室这么感兴趣呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我是为一个人呀。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "那祝你好运吧。喂，杰瑞。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "这几天又有几个八卦微博在说你已婚的事情，我们经纪部出了几个方案，需要你配合一下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "让他们说就好了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我这几天没空。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你是我的粉丝会会长，你想见我一面并不难啊，这是何必呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are president of my fan club — meeting me wasn't hard in the first place, so why go to such lengths?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "说吧，你这次见我什么事？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Go ahead and tell me why you wanted to see me this time.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "总编室淳于总制作人这次的改版方案非常大胆，我个人非常喜欢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chief Producer Chun Yuqiao's revamp proposal from the chief editor's office is remarkably bold, and I personally love it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "好，我会帮忙的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright — I will help.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我自己加盟十二歌王，然后参加宣传，你看这样怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'll join Twelve Singers myself and take part in the publicity — how does that sound?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "不愧是商业世家之子呀，真是人尽其用。我没问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Spoken like the heir to a business family — putting everyone's strengths to full use. Count me in.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "不过我很好奇，你为什么对这个总编室这么感兴趣呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Though I am curious: why are you taking such an interest in Xingtian's chief editor's office?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我是为一个人呀。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm doing it for someone special.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "那祝你好运吧。喂，杰瑞。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then I wish you good luck. Hello?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "这几天又有几个八卦微博在说你已婚的事情，我们经纪部出了几个方案，需要你配合一下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Over the past few days several gossip accounts on Weibo started claiming you're secretly married; management drafted response plans for you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "让他们说就好了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just let them talk.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我这几天没空。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don't have spare time over the next few days.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你是我的粉丝会会长，你想见我一面并不难啊，这是何必呢？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "说吧，你这次见我什么事？",
      "gap": 0.5
